+// synthetic) compared it with the B-anchored target C(B) + slot - display(B)
+// (B's own latency, "(b)"): (a) was nearer the real middle frame in time and
+// image on all eight sequences, and the only placement to halve the distance
+// to the constant-latency line (0.74 ms against 1.4-1.9 ms for the display
